WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.069
Mercury, number one.

2
00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:07.231
It is the closest to the sun.

3
00:00:07.232 --> 00:00:10.491
Venus bright, number two.

4
00:00:10.492 --> 00:00:15.319
Morning and evening star we view.

5
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.638
Planet Earth, number three.

6
00:00:18.639 --> 00:00:23.013
We live on it, you and me.

7
00:00:23.014 --> 00:00:27.237
Planet Mars, number four.

8
00:00:27.238 --> 00:00:31.654
Named after the Roman god of war.

9
00:00:31.655 --> 00:00:34.911
Number five, Jupiter.

10
00:00:34.912 --> 00:00:39.714
Colored clouds around it stir.

11
00:00:39.715 --> 00:00:43.183
Number six, big Saturn.

12
00:00:43.184 --> 00:00:47.270
Many rings around it turn.

13
00:00:47.271 --> 00:00:50.559
Number seven, Uranus.

14
00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:54.291
It looks blue and green to us.

15
00:00:54.292 --> 00:00:57.577
Number eight, stormy Neptune.

16
00:00:57.578 --> 00:01:02.557
Triton is its frozen moon.

17
00:01:02.558 --> 00:01:05.336
The eight planets that we know.

18
00:01:05.337 --> 00:01:12.589
Round and round the sun they go.

